  "cooperativa": {
    "breadcrumbHome": "Home",
    "breadcrumbTitle": "The Cooperative",
    "pageTitle": "Who We Are",
    "pageSubtitle": "Grupo Peñascal is a non-profit social initiative dedicated to the integration and personal, social, and labor development of people in situations of vulnerability or exclusion.",
    "about": {
      "p1": "We are a social initiative entity, non-profit and declared of public utility, born in Bilbao in 1986, whose purpose focuses on integrating into society people who are in a situation or at risk of exclusion due to various personal, academic, or social circumstances.",
      "p2": "We promote professional qualification, with values and attitudes of responsibility and solidarity, so that people are sovereign and active protagonists in their own lives and in society.",
      "p3": "At Peñascal Kooperatiba, our mission is the integration of people, especially those in disadvantaged situations, and for this we work on their training and professional qualification, labor activation, job creation, promoting attitudes and values of solidarity and citizenship. We attend to people who need a positive change in their professional, personal, and social competencies, helping them find motivation and accompanying them to go through a comprehensive itinerary so they can live integrated in our society.",
      "p4": "We work as holders of several training centers in different areas of the Basque Country and Navarre where people learn from young people aged 14 to adults up to 65 years old. In our training spaces, people learn teachings from the education system (Vocational Training, Basic Education for Adults, Complementary Schooling Programs), or carry out vocational training actions for employment or actions to improve their personal and labor situation throughout life.",
      "p5": "In addition to the activity in the training field, we are committed to employment. We actively collaborate with Employment Services, carry out orientation for employment, and intermediate with companies to ensure that users find a job.",
      "p6": "Aware also of the need to contribute to wealth generation in our environment, we create and manage insertion companies that respect the values and style of the entity."
    },
    "mission": {
      "title": "Our Mission",
      "desc": "Promote social and labor inclusion through comprehensive training, personalized guidance, and job creation in insertion companies, betting on community development."
    },
    "values": {
